<title>SWITZERLAND: Roche to publish Q1 sales early Tuesday.</title>
<headline>Roche to publish Q1 sales early Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>BASLE, Switzerland 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss pharmaceuticals group Roche Holding AG said it would announce sales figures for the first quarter of 1997 at 0500 GMT on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Roche is also holding its annual news conference on Tuesday in Basle.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
